    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d312">

                <pb facs="0386" n="376" sameAs="frus:frus1945v03/pg376"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Control (Germany)/1–1145</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of the Treasury</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Morgenthau</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-01-11">January 11,
                        1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>There is attached a memorandum which I am sending to the President, relating to
                    the problem of what to do with Germany after her defeat.</p>
                <p>I am looking forward to discussing the German problem with you next
                        Wednesday.<anchor n="43" xml:id="d312-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry Morgenthau</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d312-a1.xml" xpointer="d312-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
